Package: travelgrid
Type: Package
Title: Measures the travel time across a landscape
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-09-01
Authors@R: person("Chris", "Littleboy", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "chris.littleboy@stir.ac.uk")
Description: Calculates travel time across a landscape using information about
    topography, the built environment, and target features. This allows many-to-many,
    many-to-one, and one-to-many travel-time calculations. The method is illustrated
    by measuring proximity to green and blue spaces in Scotland, an important issue
    for public policy, particularly urban planning and health.
